 "lines": [
  {
   "n": 1,
   "text": "They say this free tool killed Claude Code's token problem,",
   "start": 0.04,
   "end": 3.56,
   "role": "hook: the viral claim"
  },
  {
   "n": 2,
   "text": "and your twenty-dollar plan now does hundred-dollar work.",
   "start": 3.75,
   "end": 6.3,
   "role": "the money claim"
  },
  {
   "n": 3,
   "text": "Every new chat starts from zero, so Claude Code reads your files again.",
   "start": 6.49,
   "end": 9.94,
   "role": "the problem (real)"
  },
  {
   "n": 4,
   "text": "The fix is Graphify, with about a hundred fifty thousand stars on GitHub.",
   "start": 10.13,
   "end": 13.53,
   "role": "the tool + stars"
  },
  {
   "n": 5,
   "text": "It maps your code once, so Claude looks things up instead of rereading.",
   "start": 13.72,
   "end": 16.86,
   "role": "how it works"
  },
  {
   "n": 6,
   "text": "The big claim is seventy times less token use, but only in its best case.",
   "start": 17.05,
   "end": 20.63,
   "role": "reveal 1: where 70 comes from"
  },
  {
   "n": 7,
   "text": "Real tests? One saves some. One uses more.",
   "start": 20.82,
   "end": 23.35,
   "role": "reveal 2: other people's tests"
  },
  {
   "n": 8,
   "text": "And the hundred-dollar plan is five times the usage. Nothing we found comes close.",
   "start": 23.54,
   "end": 29.03,
   "role": "reveal 3: the money verdict"
  },
  {
   "n": 9,
   "text": "The setup's in the link in bio.",
   "start": 29.22,
   "end": 31.03,
   "role": "saveable card + link in bio"
  },
  {
   "n": 10,
   "text": "Tomorrow, five AIs face a maze. Follow, so you see who gets lost.",
